{"id":278,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"本物に触れる探究で知的好奇心を育む成蹊","feature_description":"成蹊中学校は「本物に触れる学び」を通じて、知的好奇心や科学的探究心を育てています。授業は教室だけでなく、生物・地学の実験講義室や金工室、美術室、書道室、音楽室、調理室、体育館、サッカー場なども活用します。生物では学内の自然を使った実習を行います。英語は少人数授業で、ネイティブ教員による指導も受けられます。多彩な施設で実践的な学びを支えます。","clubs":[{"id":4144,"name":"家庭部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.seikei.ac.jp/jsh/schoollife/club_seitokai/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":4145,"name":"サッカー部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.seikei.ac.jp/jsh/schoollife/club_seitokai/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":13079,"name":"剣道部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.seikei.ac.jp/jsh/schoollife/club_seitokai/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":13080,"name":"硬式テニス部（男）","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.seikei.ac.jp/jsh/schoollife/club_seitokai/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":13081,"name":"硬式テニス部（女）","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.seikei.ac.jp/jsh/schoollife/club_seitokai/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":13082,"name":"山岳部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.seikei.ac.jp/jsh/schoollife/club_seitokai/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":13083,"name":"水泳部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.seikei.ac.jp/jsh/schoollife/club_seitokai/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":13084,"name":"ソフトテニス部（男）","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.seikei.ac.jp/jsh/schoollife/club_seitokai/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":13085,"name":"ソフトテニス部（女）","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.seikei.ac.jp/jsh/schoollife/club_seitokai/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":13086,"name":"卓球部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.seikei.ac.jp/jsh/schoollife/club_seitokai/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":13087,"name":"バスケットボール部（男）","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.seikei.ac.jp/jsh/schoollife/club_seitokai/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":13088,"name":"バスケットボール部（女）","category":"運動部","so